    "body": "Adds an `llms.txt` file following the emerging [llms.txt convention](https://llmstxt.org/) — a curated, structured Markdown index that helps AI assistants and LLM-based tools navigate the site's documentation more effectively than crawling raw HTML.\n\nThe file covers Getting Started, Core Reference, Editing/Navigation, Scripting & Extensibility, Built-in Tooling, Developer Docs, and an Optional section (FAQ, News, Screenshots) — linking to the most-used pages out of the ~150 generated doc pages rather than an exhaustive dump, per the convention's intent of a concise, high-signal index.\n\nPlaced at `static/llms.txt` so it's served at `https://neovim.io/llms.txt`, following the same static-passthrough convention already used for `favicon.ico` and other root-level files in this repo.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-30T17:01:08Z",
