            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "what evidence is there that AI models care about this, these days?\r\n\r\n> linking to the most-used pages out of the ~150 generated doc pages rather than an exhaustive dump\r\n\r\n? based on what, why. we can't maintain this and it's arbitrary. LLMs can figure it out.",
